<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The following
constitute the Disclosure Schedules (the &ldquo;<B>Disclosure Schedules</B>&rdquo;) referred to in the Securities Purchase Agreement dated
as of August 13, 2025 (the &ldquo;<B>Agreement</B>&rdquo;) by and among VCI Global Limited, a British Virgin Islands business company
